      * Form length 20, overflow line 15, headings again on overflow.
     H
     FQSYSPRT O   F      80     OF    LPRINTER
     LQSYSPRT  20FL 15OL
     C                     EXCPTHEAD
     C           1         DO   25        I       30
     C                     EXCPTDET
     C   OF                EXCPTHEAD
     C   OF                SETOF                     OF
     C                     END
     C                     SETON                     LR
     OQSYSPRT E  2 2           HEAD
     O                                   20 'HEADING'
     O                         PAGE  Z   30
     OQSYSPRT E  1             DET
     O                                    8 'LINE'
     O                         I     Z   12
     OQSYSPRT T 2      LR
     O                                   12 'END'
